==Description==
'''Happy Feet''' emote is an emote that could be obtained at level 9 of the regular [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]]. It was made by STEALTH_NOVA. The emote is looped but not moveable or interactable. No music can be heard while performing this emote.

It had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|240}} or {{Robux|48}} ({{Robux|40}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total of {{DuckyEggs|1,150}} or {{Robux|460}} ({{Robux|387}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

